WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:01.560
Don't worry

00:01.640 --> 00:03.680
I'll go out personally to explain to them

00:10.000 --> 00:28.000
Wu Jun's army mobilized immediately: the main force swung south to envelop the volunteer army, while the rest assaulted the city with full might. Unable to retreat inside the walls in time, you were left with no choice but to fight to the death.

